Change-Id: If2b6214eaa194779636458531ecd8dce391c6a22

[gki6677 reshape note - 2026-11-04, Z.ai]
Reshaped for the 6.6.77 pin (deprecated/android15-6.6-2025-03 @
8d05d8f2439f): upstream re-anchors on the post-subsectional-GC
early-exit form of __set_test_and_free() (goto unlock_out), while
the pin still carries the nested form with the skip_free label.
The four added statements are byte-identical to upstream and are
inserted inside the pin's section-fully-freed branch
(test_and_clear_bit on free_secmap == true, right after
free_sections++), the exact guard upstream's fall-through reaches,
so the net semantics are unchanged; braces are added because the
pin pre-image is a single-statement if. The added lines exceed 80
columns at the pin's nesting depth - kept verbatim over reflow per
the reshape discipline. All referenced symbols (GET_SEC_FROM_SEG,
next_victim_seg, NULL_SEGNO) exist at the pin (f2fs.h:1697, gc.c).
Verified: statement-order compare vs upstream post-state; strict
git apply --cached on the pin index (and at this patch's series
position in the full B-3b rehearsal).

Origin: android.googlesource.com/kernel/common 42c080cdf5fb852853459d409660ca8e29e334f4
Batch: B-3b (P4 pre-window sweep 2025-04..2026-01) - Class B reshape (owner-approved 2026-11-03), re-anchored for the pin; predicted ABI delta zero

---
diff --git a/fs/f2fs/segment.h b/fs/f2fs/segment.h
index 943be4f1d..2e7e774d5 100644
--- a/fs/f2fs/segment.h
+++ b/fs/f2fs/segment.h
@@ -474,8 +474,14 @@ static inline void __set_test_and_free(struct f2fs_sb_info *sbi,
 		next = find_next_bit(free_i->free_segmap,
 				start_segno + SEGS_PER_SEC(sbi), start_segno);
 		if (next >= start_segno + usable_segs) {
-			if (test_and_clear_bit(secno, free_i->free_secmap))
+			if (test_and_clear_bit(secno, free_i->free_secmap)) {
 				free_i->free_sections++;
+
+				if (GET_SEC_FROM_SEG(sbi, sbi->next_victim_seg[BG_GC]) == secno)
+					sbi->next_victim_seg[BG_GC] = NULL_SEGNO;
+				if (GET_SEC_FROM_SEG(sbi, sbi->next_victim_seg[FG_GC]) == secno)
+					sbi->next_victim_seg[FG_GC] = NULL_SEGNO;
+			}
 		}
 	}
 skip_free:
